<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marsh &amp; McLennan raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marsh &amp; McLennan raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its recommendation on Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc to near-term accumulate from near-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-3/4 to 106-1/8 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
